{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"leemore-marrett-jr","name":"Leemore Marrett Jr.","birthDate":"1996-01-01","birthPlace":"","bio":"Leemore trained at The Royal Central School of Speech and Drama. Since graduating, Leemore’s theatre credits include Ed Hall’s Chariots of Fire at The Gielgud Theatre, Macbeth for the Sam Wanamaker Festival at The Globe Theatre. He also played a lead in Michael Buffong’s National Tour of All My Sons (Talawa) and played a lead in Octagon at The Arcola Theatre.\n\nLeemore’s TV credits include US series Crossing Lines (Netflix), Vera (ITV), 24: Live Another Day (20th Century Fox), Utopia (C4), Silent Witness (BBC), Whitechapel (ITV), Spooks (BBC), Stolen (BBC) and Death in Paradise (BBC).\n\nFilm credits include Survivor (Millennium Films), Sundance Film Festival official selection My Brother the Devil (Wild Horses Films) and Squadron 42 (Cloud Imperium).","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:35:13+00:00","tmdbId":1649401,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1649401","credits":[{"id":"deadpool-wolverine","title":"Deadpool & Wolverine","character":"Minuteman Leader"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/leemore-marrett-jr.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Deadpool & Wolverine","year":2024,"character":"Minuteman Leader","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8cdWjvZQUExUUTzyp4t6EDMubfO.jpg"},{"name":"Three Little Birds","year":2023,"character":"Ephraim Whittaker","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/trBFtIhK23fAEse7n1T5sWzyFYN.jpg"},{"name":"My Name Is Leon","year":2022,"character":"Castro","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/l437uJQPoW1rx7szUElMQpTKrQH.jpg"},{"name":"The Batman","year":2022,"character":"Muscle Cop","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/74xTEgt7R36Fpooo50r9T25onhq.jpg"},{"name":"The Sandman","year":2022,"character":"Tourist Husband Sam","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/q54qEgagGOYCq5D1903eBVMNkbo.jpg